<title>USA: AES acquires additional Light-Servicos shrs.</title>
<headline>AES acquires additional Light-Servicos shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The AES Corp said it had acquired an additional 2.4 percent of Light-Servicos de Eletricidade, the integrated electric utility that serves Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.</p>
<p>This investment, valued at about $82 million, increases AES's holding in Light to 13.75 percent, AES said.</p>
<p>In May 1996, AES and three other partners acquired a 51 percent controlling interest in Light, the company said.</p>
